				940,
				4
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Format UpdateService and prune unused imports\n\nApply consistent line formatting to the `UpdateService` module in Mountain. Specifically, collapse multi-line `CommonError` constructors in `CheckForUpdates` and `CheckForUpdatesWithAir` to single lines where appropriate, and format the `format!` macro invocation for update messages. Remove unused `dev_log` imports from `CheckForUpdatesViaAir` and `CheckForUpdatesWithAir`.\n\nConsolidate long import statements in `CheckForUpdatesViaAir` and `IsAirAvailable` by removing line breaks for `AirLibrary` types. These changes align the update logic with the project-wide PascalCase formatting standards and reduce visual noise in the IPC integration layer.",
			"SHA": "413434283053c9973bf233970f20ae6cd3e2e33e"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-02T04:08:47Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				940,
				16
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Atomize Vine client logic into PascalCase submodules\n\nDecompose the remaining monolithic logic within the Vine gRPC client layer into a dedicated submodule tree under `Source/Vine/Client/`. This aligns with the project-wide PascalCase naming convention and the modularization pattern established in recent commits.\n\nExtract logical units into explicit files:\n- Connection lifecycle: `ConnectToSideCar`, `DisconnectFromSideCar`, `TryConnectSingle`.\n- Health & State: `CheckSideCarHealth`, `IsClientConnected`, `IsShuttingDown`, `MarkShutdown`, `WaitForClientConnection`.\n- Communication: `SendRequest`, `SendNotification`, `PublishNotification`, `PublishNotificationFromMux`.\n- Subscription model: `NotificationFrame`, `SubscribeNotifications`, `SubscriberCount`.\n- Shared state: `Shared` (connection pool, broadcast channel, shutdown flag, constants).\n\nRename all functions to the `PascalCase::Fn` pattern (e.g., `connect_to_sidecar` → `ConnectToSideCar::Fn`). Update internal callers to use full paths (e.g., `Multiplexer` invoking `PublishNotificationFromMux::Fn`). The `TryConnectSingle` implementation now includes tuned h2 transport windows for loopback traffic to Cocoon.\n\nThis structural refactor eliminates implicit imports, enforces strict naming standards across the Vine gRPC layer, and establishes a consistent namespace hierarchy for the streaming multiplexer integration.",
			"SHA": "4877b35c5f14e5d9d86301b80574757cba931d6b"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
